give your answer in terms onf n

answer:

ok so lets say we have array of 100
and only like 10 of them contains apple
arr = '(pear apple apple banana ...)

to find all apples it needs to
search everything inside the vector/list, so
if the length is N, total is N
if it encounters the 'apple', increase the counter +1
if it doesn't just continue forward/cdr down the list/vector

so its N total right? assuming increasing the counter is instant thing


